y. Decorate your home, office, or studio with your favorite art and photos - no frames, no nails needed.\n\nHOW IT WORKS:\n1. Allow access to your photos and environment.\n2. Choose an image from your device.\n3. Point at any wall to place, move, and view your art in real size.\n\nFEATURES:\n- Real-scale image display on walls and surfaces\n- Environment-aware placement using spatial data\n- Fast and simple - built for viewing only\n- Works fully on-device, no internet required\n\nPRIVACY BY DESIGN:\nArt Projector is 100% local. Your photos and spatial data never leave your headset. No account, no cloud, no analytics, no ads. See our Privacy Policy for details.\n\nPERMISSIONS USED:\n- Photos / Files: only to load images you choose.\n- Spatial / Environment data: only to detect walls for placement.\n\nSUPPORT:\nDeveloper: Hussein Al Ghazwi / Team: HusGha\nContact: husaag@gmail.com", "short_description": "Turn any room into your gallery. Place your pictures on walls in MR"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://crimson-sunset-5f69.husaag.workers.dev/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hussein Al Ghazwi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://crimson-sunset-5f69.husaag.workers.dev/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1477606558765090"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "